@startuml 01_lost_update
title 1. Why a shared counter breaks: the lost update
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
autonumber

participant "Thread A" as A
participant "Thread B" as B
database "Shared memory\nx starts at 5" as M

A -> M: read x
M --> A: 5
B -> M: read x
M --> B: 5
note over A: computes 5 + 1 = 6
note over B: computes 5 + 1 = 6
A -> M: write x = 6
B -> M: write x = 6

note over M
  Two increments ran, but x is 6, not 7.
  Thread B's write overwrote Thread A's.
  The bug is the gap between read and write.
end note
@enduml
